@format 1
@id keyframes.previous
@title Move to previous keyframe
@area Keyframes
@entry input
@summary Dispatch the previous-keyframe shortcut, resolve the nearest known keyframe strictly before the cursor, and propagate it to the timeline and preview.
@flow TB
@related keyframes.scan, keyframes.next

@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow
@alias key = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LKeyframeOrchestrator

[input] Previous-keyframe command <input>
- Dispatch the previous-keyframe shortcut when timeline commands and a spool are active @ flow.PFlowShortcutDispatch(...)
> find

[find] Find prior point <decision>
- Search stored keyframes strictly before the cursor @ key.LKeyframeMoveFind(...)
? "A prior keyframe exists" > move
? "No prior keyframe is known" > unavailable

[move] Propagate keyframe target <process>
- Update the cursor, views, keyframe scan request, and preview seek @ flow.PFlowKeyframeMove(...)
> result

[result] Previous keyframe resolved <output>
= The cursor and preview move to the nearest known prior keyframe time.

[unavailable] No previous keyframe <output>
= The move is deferred so nearby keyframes can be scanned later.
